# The shooting gallery (worlds/01_PIER.md, Key 3): in the suit, with the crop. "set pier/gallery_go" starts the game
# (levels/pier/keys/gallery.gd). The prize is one of Swyne's toys, and Nim confiscates it.

~ start
[if pier/gallery_won] => after
[if not gear_crop] => nocrop
[if not pier/in_suit] => garb
Barker: Roll up, roll up! Six targets, thirty seconds, one fabulous prize!
Barker: Ooh, a lady with a crop. Fancy your chances, Madame?
- I'll play. => play
- Not tonight. => END

~ play
Barker: Crack 'em all before the bell and the prize is yours. Off you go!
set pier/gallery_go
=> END

~ nocrop
Barker: No crop, no shoot, love. House rules. The cheetah's got one. She's always got one.

~ garb
Barker: Not in that, love. This stall's for a better class of customer. Come back dressed for it.

~ lost
Barker [grin]: Ooh, so close! Tricky little blighters, those targets. Have another go!

~ won
Barker [shock]: All six? Nobody gets all six. They're not supposed to... I mean. Congratulations! Your prize!
[narrator] The prize is a boxed plushie with a spiral printed on its belly. It hums.
Nim: Where did you get this?
Barker: Comes in a crate, every night. Everyone wins one! Mr. Laffer's orders.
Nim: Confiscated.
Barker: You can't confiscate a prize!
Nim: Watch me.

~ after
Barker: You've had your prize. Go on. Shoo.
